<VI _name="lvai_icon_apply_and_save_n.vi" description="Push a .lvclass or plain .lvlib icon onto members as their NI_Library template layer and SAVE each member. Opens the owner (LVClass.Open, or Library.Open when is library is true), opens EVERY VI named in vi paths so it is in memory, runs ApplyIconToVIs, then Save.Instrument and Close Reference per VI, then saves the owner. Opening first is required for a plain .lvlib - Library.Open loads no members and ApplyIconToVIs then changes nothing, silently. ApplyIconToVIs alone saves no member. vi paths is ONE string of absolute paths separated by semicolons with NO trailing semicolon - Spreadsheet String To Array turns a trailing one into an empty path and Error 7. Per-member codes in open codes and save codes, in input order. Run with the project CLOSED (open - Error 1562). Measured 2026-09-25 on LabVIEW 2026 Q3 with labview-mcp 1.7.2 in a pilot project (4 of 4 class members, 41 of 41 members over classes and plain libraries). Measured 2026-10-08 on LabVIEW 2026 Q3 32-bit with labview-mcp 1.8.5 in a pilot project (a class with six members, project closed).">
